  "handle": "a-million-times-72-black-sterling",
  "description": "<p>This <em>A million Times 72 </em>features sterling clock hands, is crafted and milled in a stone-like mineral composite and is available in either black or white.</p>\n<p><meta charset=\"utf-8\"><span>The artwork is hand-assembled in our Stockholm studio </span><span>and is part of the <em>A million Times 72 </em>edition, which is limited to just 82 pieces.</span><span> </span><br><br><meta charset=\"utf-8\">The first <em>A million Times</em> installation was exhibited in 2013 at the design fairs in Dubai and Basel. Since then artworks from this series have been included in internationally significant exhibitions at the Somerset House (UK), Smithsonian Design Museum (US), Issey Miyake's museum \"21_21 Design Sight\" (JP) and many more.<br></p>\n<!---->",
